        "id": "official-four-service-stack",
        "upstream_behavior": "The official Compose runs TeslaMate, PostgreSQL, Grafana and Mosquitto.",
        "native_lxc_behavior": "The generic OCI stack driver creates one native LXC per service with ordered startup and private service aliases.",
        "reason": "Preserve the complete upstream application without Docker Engine.",
        "behavioral_impact": "TeslaMate and Grafana receive frontend addresses; the database and MQTT broker remain private.",
